* [FastAPI](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/)
* [OpenAI](https://platform.openai.com/)
* [Groq](https://groq.com/)
* [Gemini](https://ai.google.dev/)
* [Uvicorn](https://www.uvicorn.org/)
* Python 3.11+

